  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TV White Space Wi-Fi Rural Connectivity, through Adaptrum, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study in the form of a pilot project (Pilot) that would test the viability of television white space (TVWS) networks at three sites in South Africa, as well as produce a business plan, a financing plan, and a white paper. These documents would be used to promote the development of multiple TVWS networks across South Africa among members of The Wireless Access Providers&apos; Association, which is the grantee.</narrative>
  </description>
